4895/1ff64a860456df8e60467e6c497acba2_102981929500718779.png\" alt=\"\"> <span>链刃</span></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table style=\"border-color:#ffffff;line-height:1;font-size:16px;min-width:25px;border-collapse:collapse;\" class=\"\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\"><colgroup><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2024/03/21/77124895/13dd655f66a36109c6303d302e947f14_495074128391684664.gif\" href=\"\" style=\"border:none;vertical-align:middle;\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></li></ul> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">凶锐之牙</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(250,140,22,1)\">同调(I&nbsp;/II&nbsp;/III)阶</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">角色造成的全伤害提高</span><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(38,38,38,1)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">4.0%/8.0%/12.0%</span><span style=\"color:rgba(38,38,38,1)\">)</span></strong>，<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>星环爆发</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;星环爆发&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;状态：星之环中的特殊强化状态，根据加护赋予角色特殊能力&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span>状态下全伤害额外提<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">高</span><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(38,38,38,1)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">2.0%/4.0%/6.0%</span><span style=\"color:rgba(38,38,38,1)\">)</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">黠慧之翼</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(250,140,22,1)\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:0秒]</span></strong>武器主动技能的冷却时间、充能次数、技能效果由装备角色的类型决定</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">交错之爪</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">普通攻击命中敌人后，角色分支攻击造成的全伤害提升<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">35.0%</span></strong>，持续20秒。重复触发刷新持续时间。分支攻击命中敌人后，角色普通攻击造成的全伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">35.0%</span></strong>，持续20秒，重复触发刷新持续时间。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22general%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22gainMethod%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E9%80%94%E5%BE%84%22%2C%22gainMethod%22%3A%5B%7B%22key%22%3A%22%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87%E9%94%BB%E9%80%A0%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1136%2Fdetail%3Fbbs_presentation_style%3Dno_header%5C%22%20data-type%3D%5C%22obc-content%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%E9%80%86%E7%86%B5%C2%B7%E8%99%9A%E6%95%B0%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%3C%2Fa%3Ex150%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%5D%7D%7D%2C%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22stigmata%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22material%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22list%22%3A%5B%7B%22level%22%3A%2235%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89%E5%88%86%E7%BB%93%E6%99%B6%22%2C%22count%22%3A3%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1132%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22count%22%3A1%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%9B%B8%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E9%95%9C%E9%9D%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A3%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1273%2Fdetail%22%